{"h":"<h3><strong>Qwen 图像分层(GGUF) i2L-T2L(子图) 工作流程</strong></h3><p><strong>使用GGU模型是为了轻便，使用速度更快的Lora，</strong></p><p><strong>所以结果可能会有噪音。</strong></p><p>您可以在之间切换<strong>图像分层</strong>和<strong>文字分层</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/fe0a8767-32b3-4635-b700-8f0182253a46/width=525/fe0a8767-32b3-4635-b700-8f0182253a46.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><strong><em>注意：绕过将文本加载图像到分层</em></strong></p><h2><strong><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/0ae53993-eebf-406c-82b0-f7dda9c2e713/width=525/0ae53993-eebf-406c-82b0-f7dda9c2e713.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/26380214-1e1a-4f69-99c7-c287e7ef30c5/width=525/26380214-1e1a-4f69-99c7-c287e7ef30c5.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><strong><em>请将子图节点中的文本设置为分层编号。</em></strong></p><p>GGUF 型号（选择适合您环境的型号）</p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/QuantStack/Qwen-Image-Layered-GGUF/tree/main\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">QuantStack/Qwen-Image-Layered-GGUF 主目录</a></p><p>使用自定义节点</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/city96/ComfyUI-GGUF#comfyui-gguf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/city96/ComfyUI-GGUF#comfyui-gguf</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy</a></p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":{"en":"<h3><strong>Qwen Image Layered(GGUF) i2L-T2L(Subgraph) Workflow</strong></h3><p><strong>The GGU model is used for lightness, and the faster Lora is used,</strong></p><p><strong>so the results may be noisy.</strong></p><p>You can switch between<strong>image to layered</strong>and<strong>text to layered</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/fe0a8767-32b3-4635-b700-8f0182253a46/width=525/fe0a8767-32b3-4635-b700-8f0182253a46.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><strong><em>Note: Bypass Load Image for text to Layered</em></strong></p><h2><strong><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/0ae53993-eebf-406c-82b0-f7dda9c2e713/width=525/0ae53993-eebf-406c-82b0-f7dda9c2e713.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/26380214-1e1a-4f69-99c7-c287e7ef30c5/width=525/26380214-1e1a-4f69-99c7-c287e7ef30c5.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><strong><em>Please Set the Text to Layered number in the subgraph node.</em></strong></p><p>GGUF models (Choose the one that suits your environment)</p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/QuantStack/Qwen-Image-Layered-GGUF/tree/main\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">QuantStack/Qwen-Image-Layered-GGUF at main</a></p><p>Use Custom Node</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/city96/ComfyUI-GGUF#comfyui-gguf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/city96/ComfyUI-GGUF#comfyui-gguf</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy</a></p>"}}